  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-firewall",
      "text": "Offline-first static admission scanner for DeepSeek Harness community plugins.\n\n`/plugin-firewall <path>` inspects a local plugin package before you trust it. v0.1 looks for package install scripts, git/URL dependencies, native addons, Cordis/profile patches, tool registration, process/network/filesystem/environment access indicators, and emits a deterministic risk receipt with a SHA-256 digest."
    },
    {
      "section": "v0.1 goals",
      "text": "- no network calls or vulnerability database;\n- deterministic local analysis;\n- explicit LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH findings;\n- JSON-safe receipt with digest;\n- never executes the scanned plugin;\n- does not claim malware detection or complete supply-chain safety."
    },
    {
